  "goodToKnow": "Die Verwahrung is safekeeping or custody: etwas in Verwahrung geben, nehmen. In criminal law, die Sicherungsverwahrung is preventive detention for dangerous offenders after they've served their sentence; in 2011 the Constitutional Court demanded it be reformed to differ clearly from prison. Verwahren means to keep safe, and sich gegen etwas verwahren to protest against it. Plural: die Verwahrungen."
